window.ODE.quizBank = [{"id":"q1-1","sec":"s1","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"方程式 \\(x^{2}y''+xy'+y=e^{x}\\) 的<b>階<\/b>與<b>次<\/b>分別是？","why":"最高階導數是 \\(y''\\) → 階 \\(=2\\)；它的次方是 1 → 次 \\(=1\\)。右邊的 \\(e^{x}\\) 不影響階與次。","choices":["階 2、次 1","階 2、次 2","階 1、次 1","階 3、次 1"],"a":0,"ansText":"階 2、次 1"},{"id":"q1-2","sec":"s1","lv":1,"type":"tf","q":"\\(y'+y^{2}=x\\) 是線性微分方程。","why":"\\(y^{2}\\) 使 \\(y\\) 的次方不為 1 → <b>非線性<\/b>。線性要求 \\(y\\) 與其導數都只出現一次方。","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":1,"ansText":"錯 (False)"},{"id":"q1-3","sec":"s1","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"一個 \\(n\\) 階 ODE 的<b>通解<\/b>含有多少個獨立的任意常數？","why":"這是通解的定義：\\(n\\) 階就是 \\(n\\) 個獨立常數。二階 → 2 個，一階 → 1 個。","choices":["\\(n\\) 個","1 個","0 個","任意多個"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(n\\) 個"},{"id":"q1-4","sec":"s1","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"\\(y=Ce^{3x}\\)（\\(C\\) 為任意常數）是 \\(y'=3y\\) 的解，這個解屬於？","why":"含任意常數 \\(C\\) → 通解。給定 \\(y(0)=y_0\\) 定出 \\(C\\) 之後才叫特解。","choices":["通解 general solution","特解 particular solution","奇異解 singular solution","不是解"],"a":0,"ansText":"通解 general solution"},{"id":"q1-5","sec":"s1","lv":2,"type":"num","q":"方程式 \\((y')^{2}+y=0\\) 的<b>次 (degree)<\/b> 是多少？（填整數）","why":"次 = 最高階導數的次方。最高階是 \\(y'\\)，它被平方 → 次 \\(=2\\)。","a":2,"ansText":"2","tol":0.01},{"id":"q1-6","sec":"s1","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"一階 ODE 的初值問題 \\(y'=f(x,y),\\;y(x_{0})=y_{0}\\) 需要幾個初始條件才能定出特解？","why":"<b>幾個常數就配幾個條件<\/b>：一階 → 1 個，二階 → 2 個（\\(y(x_0)\\) 與 \\(y'(x_0)\\)）。","choices":["1 個","2 個","0 個","看方程式次數"],"a":0,"ansText":"1 個"},{"id":"q1-7","sec":"s1","lv":1,"type":"tf","q":"微分方程的解必須在整個實數線上成立，才算是這個方程的解。","why":"解只要在<b>某個區間<\/b> \\(I\\) 上成為恆等式即可。例如 \\(y=1/x\\) 就只能在 \\((0,\\infty)\\) 或 \\((-\\infty,0)\\) 上談。","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":1,"ansText":"錯 (False)"},{"id":"q1-8","sec":"s1","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"下列哪一個<b>不是<\/b>線性微分方程？","why":"\\(y^{2}\\) 是二次項 → 非線性。其餘三個的 \\(y\\) 與導數都只出現一次方，係數只依賴 \\(x\\)。","choices":["\\(y''+xy=x^{2}\\)","\\(xy'+y=\\sin x\\)","\\(y'+y^{2}=0\\)","\\(y'''-y=0\\)"],"a":2,"ansText":"\\(y'+y^{2}=0\\)"},{"id":"q2-1","sec":"s2","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"下列哪一個方程是<b>可分離<\/b>的？","why":"\\(y'=xy\\) 可以寫成 \\(\\frac{dy}{y}=x\\,dx\\)（兩邊各自只含一個變數）。其餘三個無法把 \\(x\\) 與 \\(y\\) 分開。","choices":["\\(y'=xy\\)","\\(y'=x+y\\)","\\(y'=x^{2}+y^{2}\\)","\\(y'=\\sin(x+y)\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y'=xy\\)"},{"id":"q2-2","sec":"s2","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"解 \\(y'=-2xy,\\;y(0)=3\\)。","why":"\\(\\frac{dy}{y}=-2x\\,dx\\Rightarrow \\ln|y|=-x^{2}+c\\Rightarrow y=Ce^{-x^{2}}\\)；\\(y(0)=C=3\\)。","choices":["\\(y=3e^{-x^{2}}\\)","\\(y=3e^{-2x}\\)","\\(y=e^{-x^{2}}+3\\)","\\(y=3e^{x^{2}}\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y=3e^{-x^{2}}\\)"},{"id":"q2-3","sec":"s2","lv":1,"type":"tf","q":"分離變數時若除以含 \\(y\\) 的式子，可能會弄丟常數解。","why":"例如 \\(y'=y(1-y)\\) 除以 \\(y(1-y)\\) 之後，\\(y\\equiv0\\) 與 \\(y\\equiv1\\) 就被丟掉了，要另外補回來。","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":0,"ansText":"對 (True)"},{"id":"q2-4","sec":"s2","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"\\(y'=1+y^{2}\\) 的通解是？","why":"\\(\\int\\frac{dy}{1+y^{2}}=x+c\\Rightarrow\\arctan y=x+c\\Rightarrow y=\\tan(x+c)\\)。","choices":["\\(y=\\tan(x+c)\\)","\\(y=\\arctan(x+c)\\)","\\(\\ln(1+y^{2})=x+c\\)","\\(y=e^{x+c}\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y=\\tan(x+c)\\)"},{"id":"q2-5","sec":"s2","lv":2,"type":"num","q":"若 \\(y'=\\dfrac{x}{y}\\) 且 \\(y(0)=2\\)，則 \\(y^{2}-x^{2}\\) 等於多少？（填數字）","why":"\\(y\\,dy=x\\,dx\\Rightarrow y^{2}=x^{2}+C\\)；\\(y(0)=2\\Rightarrow C=4\\)。","a":4,"ansText":"4","tol":0.01},{"id":"q2-6","sec":"s2","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"對 \\(y'=(x+y)^{2}\\)，令 \\(u=x+y\\) 之後會得到哪個可分離方程？","why":"\\(u=x+y\\Rightarrow u'=1+y'=1+u^{2}\\)。這是 \\(y'=f(ax+by+c)\\) 型的標準作法。","choices":["\\(u'=1+u^{2}\\)","\\(u'=u^{2}\\)","\\(u'=1-u^{2}\\)","\\(u'=2u\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(u'=1+u^{2}\\)"},{"id":"q2-7","sec":"s2","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"\\(y'=y^{2}-4\\) 的<b>常數解（平衡解）<\/b>是？","why":"令 \\(y'=0\\Rightarrow y^{2}=4\\Rightarrow y=\\pm2\\)。這兩個解在分離時會從 \\(y^{2}-4\\) 被除掉，記得補回來。","choices":["\\(y=\\pm2\\)","\\(y=0\\) 與 \\(y=4\\)","\\(y=4\\)","沒有常數解"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y=\\pm2\\)"},{"id":"q2-8","sec":"s2","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"看到 \\(y'\\) 只與 \\(\\dfrac{y}{x}\\) 有關（齊次型），標準代換是？","why":"令 \\(u=y/x\\) → \\(y=ux\\)、\\(y'=u+xu'\\)，代回後得到 \\(x u'=f(u)-u\\)，就可分離了。","choices":["\\(u=\\dfrac{y}{x}\\)","\\(u=x+y\\)","\\(u=xy\\)","\\(u=y-x\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(u=\\dfrac{y}{x}\\)"},{"id":"q3-1","sec":"s3","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"\\(M(x,y)dx+N(x,y)dy=0\\) 為<b>正合<\/b>的充要條件是？","why":"正合的意思就是「存在 \\(F\\) 使 \\(dF=M\\,dx+N\\,dy\\)」，由 \\(F_{xy}=F_{yx}\\) 得到 \\(M_y=N_x\\)。","choices":["\\(\\dfrac{\\partial M}{\\partial y}=\\dfrac{\\partial N}{\\partial x}\\)","\\(\\dfrac{\\partial M}{\\partial x}=\\dfrac{\\partial N}{\\partial y}\\)","\\(M=N\\)","\\(\\dfrac{\\partial M}{\\partial y}=-\\dfrac{\\partial N}{\\partial x}\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(\\dfrac{\\partial M}{\\partial y}=\\dfrac{\\partial N}{\\partial x}\\)"},{"id":"q3-2","sec":"s3","lv":1,"type":"tf","q":"\\((2xy-3)dx+(x^{2}+4y)dy=0\\) 是正合的。","why":"\\(M_y=2x\\)，\\(N_x=2x\\) → 相等 → 正合。","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":0,"ansText":"對 (True)"},{"id":"q3-3","sec":"s3","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"接上題，\\((2xy-3)dx+(x^{2}+4y)dy=0\\) 的通解是？","why":"\\(F=\\int(2xy-3)dx=x^{2}y-3x+k(y)\\)，再由 \\(F_y=x^{2}+k'=x^{2}+4y\\Rightarrow k=2y^{2}\\)。","choices":["\\(x^{2}y-3x+2y^{2}=c\\)","\\(x^{2}y+2y^{2}=c\\)","\\(xy^{2}-3x=c\\)","\\(x^{2}+y^{2}=c\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(x^{2}y-3x+2y^{2}=c\\)"},{"id":"q3-4","sec":"s3","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"用 \\(F=\\int M\\,dx+k(y)\\) 求位能函數時，\\(k'(y)\\) 等於？","why":"因為 \\(F_y=\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\int M\\,dx+k'(y)\\) 必須等於 \\(N\\)，所以 \\(k'(y)=N-\\frac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\int M\\,dx\\)。","choices":["\\(N-\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\displaystyle\\int M\\,dx\\)","\\(N\\)","\\(M\\)","一定等於 0"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(N-\\dfrac{\\partial}{\\partial y}\\displaystyle\\int M\\,dx\\)"},{"id":"q3-5","sec":"s3","lv":3,"type":"mc","q":"若 \\(\\dfrac{M_y-N_x}{N}\\) 只含 \\(x\\)，則積分因子為？","why":"這是標準公式（題目「只含 \\(x\\)」時用）。反過來若 \\(\\frac{N_x-M_y}{M}\\) 只含 \\(y\\)，就用 \\(e^{\\int\\frac{N_x-M_y}{M}dy}\\)。","choices":["\\(e^{\\int\\frac{M_y-N_x}{N}dx}\\)","\\(e^{\\int\\frac{N_x-M_y}{N}dx}\\)","\\(e^{\\int N\\,dx}\\)","\\(N_x-M_y\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(e^{\\int\\frac{M_y-N_x}{N}dx}\\)"},{"id":"q3-6","sec":"s3","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"\\(y\\,dx+2x\\,dy=0\\) 的（只含 \\(y\\) 的）積分因子是？","why":"\\(\\frac{N_x-M_y}{M}=\\frac{2-1}{y}=\\frac{1}{y}\\) 只含 \\(y\\) → \\(\\mu=e^{\\int dy/y}=y\\)。乘上去得 \\(y^{2}dx+2xy\\,dy=0\\)，解 \\(xy^{2}=c\\)。","choices":["\\(\\mu=y\\)","\\(\\mu=x\\)","\\(\\mu=1/y\\)","\\(\\mu=x^{2}\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(\\mu=y\\)"},{"id":"q3-7","sec":"s3","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"正合方程的解在幾何上是什麼？","why":"正合 \\(\\Leftrightarrow dF=0\\Leftrightarrow F\\) 為常數，所以解就是位能函數 \\(F\\) 的等值線。","choices":["\\(F(x,y)=c\\) 的等值線 (level curves)","一定是直線","只有一條曲線","無法描述"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(F(x,y)=c\\) 的等值線 (level curves)"},{"id":"q3-8","sec":"s3","lv":2,"type":"tf","q":"若 \\(\\dfrac{\\partial M}{\\partial y}\\neq\\dfrac{\\partial N}{\\partial x}\\) 到處成立，則方程不可能正合。","why":"正合的必要條件就是 \\(M_y=N_x\\)。若某個區域上兩者明顯不等，就只能在該區域外找 \\(F\\)，或先乘上積分因子改變 \\(M,N\\)。","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":0,"ansText":"對 (True)"},{"id":"q4-1","sec":"s4","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"\\(y'+p(x)y=r(x)\\) 的積分因子是？","why":"乘上 \\(\\mu=e^{\\int p\\,dx}\\) 後左邊變成 \\((\\mu y)'=\\mu r\\)，兩邊積分即可。","choices":["\\(e^{\\int p\\,dx}\\)","\\(e^{\\int r\\,dx}\\)","\\(e^{\\int pr\\,dx}\\)","\\(\\int p\\,dx\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(e^{\\int p\\,dx}\\)"},{"id":"q4-2","sec":"s4","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"解 \\(y'+y=e^{2x}\\)。","why":"\\(\\mu=e^{x}\\)：\\((e^{x}y)'=e^{3x}\\Rightarrow e^{x}y=\\frac13e^{3x}+C\\Rightarrow y=\\frac13e^{2x}+Ce^{-x}\\)。","choices":["\\(y=\\frac{1}{3}e^{2x}+Ce^{-x}\\)","\\(y=e^{2x}+Ce^{-x}\\)","\\(y=\\frac12e^{2x}+Ce^{-x}\\)","\\(y=\\frac13e^{2x}+C\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y=\\frac{1}{3}e^{2x}+Ce^{-x}\\)"},{"id":"q4-3","sec":"s4","lv":1,"type":"tf","q":"一階線性方程 \\(y'+p(x)y=r(x)\\) 的解可以寫成 \\(y=y_{h}+y_{p}\\)。","why":"\\(y_h\\) 是齊次解（含 \\(C\\)），\\(y_p\\) 是一個特解。這個結構在非齊次方程裡很通用。","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":0,"ansText":"對 (True)"},{"id":"q4-4","sec":"s4","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"解 \\(xy'-2y=x^{4}\\) 的<b>第一個步驟<\/b>應該是？","why":"積分因子公式只適用於 \\(y'\\) 係數為 1 的標準形。不先標準化一定算錯 —— 這是最常見的失分點。","choices":["直接套積分因子公式","兩邊除以 \\(x\\) 化成標準形 \\(y'-\\frac{2}{x}y=x^{3}\\)","令 \\(u=y/x\\)","兩邊直接積分"],"a":1,"ansText":"兩邊除以 \\(x\\) 化成標準形 \\(y'-\\frac{2}{x}y=x^{3}\\)"},{"id":"q4-5","sec":"s4","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"解 \\(xy'+2y=4x^{2}\\)。","why":"標準形 \\(y'+\\frac2xy=4x\\)，\\(\\mu=x^{2}\\)：\\((x^{2}y)'=4x^{3}\\Rightarrow x^{2}y=x^{4}+C\\)。","choices":["\\(y=x^{2}+\\dfrac{C}{x^{2}}\\)","\\(y=x^{2}+\\dfrac{C}{x}\\)","\\(y=2x+\\dfrac{C}{x}\\)","\\(y=x^{2}+C\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y=x^{2}+\\dfrac{C}{x^{2}}\\)"},{"id":"q4-6","sec":"s4","lv":2,"type":"num","q":"若 \\(y'+2xy=x\\) 的通解為 \\(y=\\frac12+Ce^{-x^{2}}\\)，求 \\(y(0)=1\\) 時的 \\(C\\)。（填數字）","why":"\\(y(0)=\\frac12+C=1\\Rightarrow C=\\frac12\\)。","a":0.5,"ansText":"0.5","tol":0.001},{"id":"q4-7","sec":"s4","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"「齊次解 (homogeneous solution)」指的是？","why":"把右邊的 \\(r(x)\\) 歸零後得到的方程之解，就是 \\(y_h=Ce^{-\\int p\\,dx}\\)。","choices":["\\(y'+p(x)y=0\\) 的解","\\(r(x)\\) 是齊次多項式","\\(y\\equiv0\\) 這個解","係數為常數的解"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y'+p(x)y=0\\) 的解"},{"id":"q4-8","sec":"s4","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"RL 電路 \\(Li'+Ri=E\\)（\\(E\\) 為常數）的<b>穩態電流<\/b>是？","why":"\\(t\\to\\infty\\) 時 \\(i'\\to0\\)，所以 \\(Ri=E\\Rightarrow i=E/R\\)（電感在穩態視為短路）。","choices":["\\(E/R\\)","0","\\(E/L\\)","\\(L/E\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(E/R\\)"},{"id":"q5-1","sec":"s5","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"二階齊次線性方程 \\(y''+p(x)y'+q(x)y=0\\) 的解空間維度是？","why":"兩個線性獨立的解就足以張出所有解 → 維度 2。這正是「通解 = \\(c_1y_1+c_2y_2\\)」的根據。","choices":["2","1","\\(n\\)","無限大"],"a":0,"ansText":"2"},{"id":"q5-2","sec":"s5","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"Wronskian \\(W(y_1,y_2)\\) 的定義是？","why":"它是 \\(\\begin{vmatrix}y_1&y_2\\\\y_1'&y_2'\\end{vmatrix}=y_1y_2'-y_2y_1'\\)。","choices":["\\(y_1y_2'-y_2y_1'\\)","\\(y_1y_2-y_1'y_2'\\)","\\(y_1'y_2'\\)","\\(y_1+y_2\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y_1y_2'-y_2y_1'\\)"},{"id":"q5-3","sec":"s5","lv":2,"type":"tf","q":"若 \\(y_1,y_2\\) 是<b>同一<\/b>二階齊次線性方程的兩個解，且 \\(W(x_0)=0\\) 對某個 \\(x_0\\) 成立，則 \\(y_1,y_2\\) 線性相依。","why":"由 Abel 公式 \\(W=W_0e^{-\\int p\\,dx}\\)，只要有一點為 0 就<b>處處<\/b>為 0 → 線性相依。注意前提是「同一方程的解」。","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":0,"ansText":"對 (True)"},{"id":"q5-4","sec":"s5","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"降階公式 \\(y_2=y_1\\displaystyle\\int\\frac{e^{-\\int p\\,dx}}{y_1^{2}}dx\\) 裡的 \\(p\\) 是？","why":"所以用公式前<b>務必先把 \\(y''\\) 的係數除成 1<\/b>，否則 \\(p\\) 會讀錯。","choices":["標準形 \\(y''+py'+qy=0\\) 中 \\(y'\\) 的係數","任意常數","\\(y\\) 的係數 \\(q\\)","積分因子"],"a":0,"ansText":"標準形 \\(y''+py'+qy=0\\) 中 \\(y'\\) 的係數"},{"id":"q5-5","sec":"s5","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"Abel 公式告訴我們 \\(W(x)=\\)？","why":"因為 \\(e^{-\\int p\\,dx}>0\\)，所以 \\(W\\) 只有「恆 0」或「處處非 0」兩種可能。","choices":["\\(W_0e^{-\\int p\\,dx}\\)","\\(W_0e^{\\int p\\,dx}\\)","\\(W_0\\)（常數）","\\(W_0p(x)\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(W_0e^{-\\int p\\,dx}\\)"},{"id":"q5-6","sec":"s5","lv":3,"type":"num","q":"以 \\(y_1=e^{-x},\\;y_2=e^{-2x}\\) 為基底時，\\(W(0)\\) 等於多少？（填數字，注意正負號）","why":"\\(W=e^{-x}(-2e^{-2x})-e^{-2x}(-e^{-x})=-e^{-3x}\\)，\\(W(0)=-1\\)。","a":-1,"ansText":"-1","tol":0.01},{"id":"q5-7","sec":"s5","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"已知 \\(y_1=x\\) 是 \\((1-x^{2})y''+2xy'-2y=0\\) 的解，用降階法得到的第二個解是？","why":"\\(p=\\frac{2x}{1-x^{2}}\\)，\\(e^{-\\int p}=1-x^{2}\\)，\\(y_2=x\\int\\frac{1-x^{2}}{x^{2}}dx=-1-x^{2}\\)，取 \\(1+x^{2}\\)。","choices":["\\(y_2=1+x^{2}\\)","\\(y_2=x^{2}\\)","\\(y_2=\\ln x\\)","\\(y_2=e^{x}\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y_2=1+x^{2}\\)"},{"id":"q5-8","sec":"s5","lv":1,"type":"tf","q":"只有在 \\(y_1,y_2\\) 線性獨立時，\\(y=c_1y_1+c_2y_2\\) 才是完整的通解。","why":"若相依（例如 \\(y_2=3y_1\\)），那其實只有一個任意常數，無法滿足任意初值 → 不是通解。","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":0,"ansText":"對 (True)"},{"id":"q6-1","sec":"s6","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"\\(y''-y'-6y=0\\) 的特徵根是？","why":"\\(\\lambda^{2}-\\lambda-6=(\\lambda-3)(\\lambda+2)=0\\)。注意先把符號抄對：方程是 \\(-y'\\)，特徵方程是 \\(-\\lambda\\)。","choices":["\\(\\lambda=3,\\;-2\\)","\\(\\lambda=2,\\;-3\\)","\\(\\lambda=6,\\;-1\\)","\\(\\lambda=\\pm\\sqrt6\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(\\lambda=3,\\;-2\\)"},{"id":"q6-2","sec":"s6","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"特徵方程有<b>重根<\/b> \\(\\lambda\\) 時，通解是？","why":"重根時第二個解要乘 \\(x\\)（由降階法得到），否則兩項會合併成一個常數倍的解。","choices":["\\((c_1+c_2x)e^{\\lambda x}\\)","\\(c_1e^{\\lambda x}+c_2e^{\\lambda x}\\)","\\(e^{\\lambda x}(c_1\\cos+c_2\\sin)\\)","\\(c_1e^{\\lambda x}\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\((c_1+c_2x)e^{\\lambda x}\\)"},{"id":"q6-3","sec":"s6","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"\\(y''+4y=0\\) 的通解是？","why":"\\(\\lambda^{2}+4=0\\Rightarrow\\lambda=\\pm2i\\)，所以 \\(\\alpha=0\\)、\\(\\beta=2\\) → \\(\\cos2x,\\sin2x\\)。","choices":["\\(c_1\\cos2x+c_2\\sin2x\\)","\\(e^{2x}(c_1+c_2x)\\)","\\(c_1e^{2x}+c_2e^{-2x}\\)","\\(c_1\\cos4x+c_2\\sin4x\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(c_1\\cos2x+c_2\\sin2x\\)"},{"id":"q6-4","sec":"s6","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"\\(y''-2y'+5y=0\\) 的通解是？","why":"\\(\\lambda=\\frac{2\\pm\\sqrt{4-20}}{2}=1\\pm2i\\) → \\(\\alpha=1\\)、\\(\\beta=2\\)，前因數是 \\(e^{x}\\)。<b>別漏掉 \\(e^{\\alpha x}\\)<\/b>。","choices":["\\(e^{x}(c_1\\cos2x+c_2\\sin2x)\\)","\\(e^{-x}(c_1\\cos2x+c_2\\sin2x)\\)","\\(c_1\\cos2x+c_2\\sin2x\\)","\\(c_1e^{x}+c_2e^{5x}\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(e^{x}(c_1\\cos2x+c_2\\sin2x)\\)"},{"id":"q6-5","sec":"s6","lv":2,"type":"num","q":"\\(y''+6y'+9y=0\\) 的特徵根（重根）\\(\\lambda\\) 是多少？（填數字）","why":"\\(\\lambda^{2}+6\\lambda+9=(\\lambda+3)^{2}=0\\Rightarrow\\lambda=-3\\)。","a":-3,"ansText":"-3","tol":0.01},{"id":"q6-6","sec":"s6","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"哪一個條件對應<b>欠阻尼（阻尼振盪）<\/b>？","why":"複根 → 解含 \\(\\cos,\\sin\\) → 振盪；負實部 → 振幅衰減。\\ \\(\\Delta>0\\) 是過阻尼，\\(\\Delta=0\\) 是臨界阻尼。","choices":["\\(\\Delta=a^{2}-4b<0\\)（共軛複根）","\\(\\Delta>0\\)（相異實根）","\\(\\Delta=0\\)（重根）","與 \\(\\Delta\\) 無關"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(\\Delta=a^{2}-4b<0\\)（共軛複根）"},{"id":"q6-7","sec":"s6","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"臨界阻尼 (critically damped) 的解型式是？","why":"臨界阻尼 \\(\\Leftrightarrow\\) 重根，所以一定出現 \\(x e^{\\lambda x}\\)。它的特色是「最快回到平衡且不越過」。","choices":["\\((c_1+c_2x)e^{\\lambda x}\\)","阻尼振盪","\\(c_1\\cos\\beta x+c_2\\sin\\beta x\\)","常數函數"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\((c_1+c_2x)e^{\\lambda x}\\)"},{"id":"q6-8","sec":"s6","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"解 \\(y''+y'-2y=0,\\;y(0)=1,\\;y'(0)=1\\)。","why":"\\(\\lambda=1,-2\\)：\\(c_1+c_2=1\\)、\\(-2c_1+c_2=1\\) → 相減得 \\(3c_1=0\\Rightarrow c_1=0,c_2=1\\) → \\(y=e^{x}\\)。","choices":["\\(y=e^{x}\\)","\\(y=e^{-2x}\\)","\\(y=e^{x}+e^{-2x}\\)","\\(y=2e^{x}-e^{-2x}\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y=e^{x}\\)"},{"id":"q6-9","sec":"s6","lv":2,"type":"num","q":"\\(m=1,\\;c=4,\\;k=4\\) 的彈簧-阻尼系統，阻尼比 \\(\\zeta=\\dfrac{c}{2\\sqrt{mk}}\\) 等於多少？（填數字）","why":"\\(\\zeta=\\frac{4}{2\\sqrt{4}}=1\\) → 恰好是<b>臨界阻尼<\/b>。","a":1,"ansText":"1","tol":0.01},{"id":"q7-1","sec":"s7","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"\\(x^{2}y''+axy'+by=0\\) 的標準試驗解是？","why":"因為 \\(x^{2}y''\\)、\\(xy'\\)、\\(y\\) 三項代入 \\(y=x^{m}\\) 後都含 \\(x^{m}\\)，可以整體約掉。","choices":["\\(y=x^{m}\\)","\\(y=e^{mx}\\)","\\(y=\\sin x\\)","\\(y=\\ln x\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(y=x^{m}\\)"},{"id":"q7-2","sec":"s7","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"Euler–Cauchy 方程的<b>指標方程<\/b>是？","why":"由 \\(x^{2}y''=m(m-1)x^{m}\\)、\\(xy'=mx^{m}\\) 得到。展開是 \\(m^{2}+(a-1)m+b=0\\)。","choices":["\\(m(m-1)+am+b=0\\)","\\(m^{2}+am+b=0\\)","\\(m(m+1)+am+b=0\\)","\\(m^{2}+b=0\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(m(m-1)+am+b=0\\)"},{"id":"q7-3","sec":"s7","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"\\(x^{2}y''-3xy'+4y=0\\) 的通解是？","why":"\\(m^{2}-4m+4=(m-2)^{2}\\) 重根 \\(m=2\\Rightarrow\\) Case II → 第二解乘 \\(\\ln x\\)。","choices":["\\((c_1+c_2\\ln x)x^{2}\\)","\\(c_1x^{2}+c_2x^{-2}\\)","\\((c_1+c_2x)e^{2x}\\)","\\(c_1\\cos(2\\ln x)+c_2\\sin(2\\ln x)\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\((c_1+c_2\\ln x)x^{2}\\)"},{"id":"q7-4","sec":"s7","lv":1,"type":"mc","q":"\\(x^{2}y''+2xy'-6y=0\\) 的指標根是？","why":"\\(m^{2}+m-6=(m+3)(m-2)=0\\)（用 \\(m^{2}+(a-1)m+b\\)，\\(a=2,b=-6\\)）。","choices":["\\(m=2,\\;-3\\)","\\(m=3,\\;-2\\)","\\(m=6,\\;-1\\)","\\(m=\\pm\\sqrt6\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(m=2,\\;-3\\)"},{"id":"q7-5","sec":"s7","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"\\(x^{2}y''+xy'+9y=0\\) 的通解是？","why":"\\(m^{2}+9=0\\Rightarrow m=\\pm3i\\)（\\(\\alpha=0\\)）。複根時三角函數裡放的是 <b>\\(\\ln x\\)<\/b> 而不是 \\(x\\)。","choices":["\\(c_1\\cos(3\\ln x)+c_2\\sin(3\\ln x)\\)","\\(c_1\\cos3x+c_2\\sin3x\\)","\\(c_1x^{3}+c_2x^{-3}\\)","\\((c_1+c_2\\ln x)x^{0}\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(c_1\\cos(3\\ln x)+c_2\\sin(3\\ln x)\\)"},{"id":"q7-6","sec":"s7","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"用 \\(x=e^{t}\\) 代換後，\\(x^{2}y''+axy'+by=0\\) 會變成？","why":"代入 \\(x^{2}y''=\\ddot y-\\dot y\\) 與 \\(xy'=\\dot y\\) 化簡即得。這也解釋了為什麼指標方程是 \\(m^{2}+(a-1)m+b=0\\)。","choices":["\\(\\ddot y+(a-1)\\dot y+by=0\\)","\\(\\ddot y+a\\dot y+by=0\\)","\\(\\ddot y+by=0\\)","\\(\\dot y+by=0\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(\\ddot y+(a-1)\\dot y+by=0\\)"},{"id":"q7-7","sec":"s7","lv":2,"type":"num","q":"\\(x^{2}y''+xy'-y=0\\) 的指標方程有兩個根，請填<b>較大的那一個<\/b> \\(m\\)。","why":"\\(m^{2}-1=0\\Rightarrow m=1,\\;-1\\)，較大的是 1（對應解 \\(x\\)）。","a":1,"ansText":"1","tol":0.01},{"id":"q7-8","sec":"s7","lv":2,"type":"tf","q":"Euler–Cauchy 方程出現重根時，兩個基底是 \\(x^{m}\\) 與 \\(x^{m}\\ln x\\)。","why":"與常係數的 \\(e^{\\lambda x},\\,xe^{\\lambda x}\\) 完全對應（把 \\(x=e^{t}\\) 想成 \\(x\\leftrightarrow e^{t}\\)、\\(\\ln x\\leftrightarrow t\\)）。","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":0,"ansText":"對 (True)"},{"id":"q8-1","sec":"s8","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"Picard–Lindelöf 定理要保證 IVP 的解<b>存在且唯一<\/b>，需要什麼條件？","why":"\\(f\\) 連續 → 存在；再加上 \\(\\partial f/\\partial y\\) 有界（Lipschitz）→ 唯一。只連續不足以保证唯一。","choices":["\\(f\\) 與 \\(\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\) 在矩形 \\(R\\) 上都連續","只要 \\(f\\) 連續即可","只要 \\(f\\) 有界","\\(f\\) 必須是線性函數"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(f\\) 與 \\(\\dfrac{\\partial f}{\\partial y}\\) 在矩形 \\(R\\) 上都連續"},{"id":"q8-2","sec":"s8","lv":1,"type":"tf","q":"\\(f(x,y)\\) 連續只能保證解存在，不能保證唯一。","why":"這就是 Peano 定理與 Picard–Lindelöf 定理的差別。\\(y'=\\sqrt{|y|},y(0)=0\\) 就是現成的反例。","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":0,"ansText":"對 (True)"},{"id":"q8-3","sec":"s8","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"\\(y'=y^{2/3},\\;y(0)=0\\) 的解的情況是？","why":"\\(\\partial f/\\partial y=\\frac23y^{-1/3}\\) 在 \\(y=0\\) 無界 → Lipschitz 失效 → 不保證唯一，而實際上真的不唯一。","choices":["不唯一：\\(y\\equiv0\\) 與 \\(y=\\dfrac{x^{3}}{27}\\) 都是解","唯一且為 \\(y\\equiv0\\)","不存在","唯一且為 \\(y=x^{3}/27\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"不唯一：\\(y\\equiv0\\) 與 \\(y=\\dfrac{x^{3}}{27}\\) 都是解"},{"id":"q8-4","sec":"s8","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"定理中 \\(h=\\min\\left(a,\\dfrac{b}{M}\\right)\\) 的 \\(M\\) 代表什麼？","why":"\\(M\\) 是 \\(f\\) 在矩形 \\(R\\) 上的最大絕對值，用來估「解最多能跑多快」。\\(K\\)（Lipschitz 常數）才是另一個量。","choices":["\\(\\max_R|f(x,y)|\\)","\\(\\max_R|\\partial f/\\partial y|\\)","常數 1","\\(\\min_R|f|\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\(\\max_R|f(x,y)|\\)"},{"id":"q8-5","sec":"s8","lv":3,"type":"num","q":"\\(y'=1+y^{2},\\;y(0)=0\\)，取 \\(R:|x|\\le1,|y|\\le1\\)，則定理保證的 \\(h=\\min(a,b/M)\\) 等於多少？（填數字）","why":"在 \\(|y|\\le1\\) 上 \\(|1+y^{2}|\\le2\\) → \\(M=2\\)，故 \\(h=\\min(1,1/2)=0.5\\)。","a":0.5,"ansText":"0.5","tol":0.001},{"id":"q8-6","sec":"s8","lv":2,"type":"mc","q":"\\((x^{2}-4)y''+3xy'+y=0\\) 且 \\(y(0)=1,\\;y'(0)=0\\)，定理保證的解存在區間是？","why":"標準化後 \\(p=\\frac{3x}{x^{2}-4}\\)、\\(q=\\frac{1}{x^{2}-4}\\) 在 \\(x=\\pm2\\) 不連續。含 \\(x_0=0\\) 的最大區間是 \\((-2,2)\\)。","choices":["\\((-2,2)\\)","\\((-\\infty,\\infty)\\)","\\((2,\\infty)\\)","\\((-\\infty,-2)\\)"],"a":0,"ansText":"\\((-2,2)\\)"},{"id":"q8-7","sec":"s8","lv":2,"type":"tf","q":"若 \\(p,q\\) 在某開區間上連續，則二階線性齊次方程的 IVP 在<b>整個<\/b>該區間上有唯一解。","why":"這是線性方程比非線性強的地方：不只保證 \\(x_0\\) 附近一小段，而是整個區間。（對照 \\(y'=1+y^{2}\\) 只能保證一小段，真實解甚至會爆掉。）","choices":["對 (True)","錯 (False)"],"a":0,"ansText":"對 (True)"}];
